{"seq":25,"slug":"game-save-serialization","title":"游戏存档与序列化","stage":"DONE","category":"game-development","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-save-serialization","rating":{"composite":3.54,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":2.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"游戏存档与序列化\">游戏存档与序列化</h1><p>玩家关掉游戏再打开，期望世界还在原处：角色站在昨晚离开的洞口，背包里还有那把没舍得用的剑，任务进度一格不差。把这一刻的「游戏世界」凝固成磁盘上的字节、又能在任意时刻原样唤醒，正是存档系统要解的题。它看似只是「写个文件」，实则牵动状态建模、序列化格式、版本兼容、引用还原、流式 IO、云同步与容错恢复一整条链路，任何一环出错都会变成玩家最痛恨的「存档丢了」。</p>\n<p>这个 hub 沿四条主线层层递进，把这条链路拆开讲透。</p>\n<p>第一条是「基础」：先说清楚为什么一个看似简单的需求会演化成工程难题，再建立「什么是游戏状态、哪些该存哪些不该存」的心智模型，最后铺垫序列化这一核心动作的本质——把内存中的对象图压平成线性字节流，再读回来。这三块是后面所有讨论的地基。</p>\n<p>第二条是「格式」：当你决定把状态写下来，立刻面对选择——二进制还是文本、用什么 schema、要不要随版本演进、要不要压缩与加密。这一章对比格式取舍，讲 schema 如何随游戏更新而平滑演进而不弃旧档，以及压缩与加密在体积、性能、防篡改之间的权衡。</p>\n<p>第三条是「技术」：有了格式，还要解决「怎么存得又快又对」。快照与增量决定每次存多少；对象图与引用决定循环引用、共享对象如何被正确还原；大世界流式存档决定一张开放地图如何在不卡顿的前提下持久化。这些是把存档系统从「能用」推向「好用」的关键技巧。</p>\n<p>第四条是「工程实践」：真实产品里存档要面对多存档槽、跨设备云同步、磁盘损坏、断电写坏、玩家作弊与无数边界情况。这一章把存档槽与云同步、损坏检测与恢复、以及常见陷阱逐一落地，让前三章的设计能在生产环境里站住脚。</p>\n<p>四条主线是一条因果链：基础定义问题，格式与技术给出可靠持久化与高效恢复的手段，工程实践则把它们锤炼成扛得住真实玩家的系统。读完你应当能为任何类型的游戏，从独立小品到开放世界大作，设计出一套可靠、可演进、可恢复的存档方案。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-save-serialization/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-save-systems","title":"为什么存档系统难","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-save-serialization/foundations/why-save-systems"},{"seq":2,"slug":"game-state-model","title":"游戏状态模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-save-serialization/foundations/game-state-model"},{"seq":3,"slug":"serialization-basics","title":"序列化基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-save-serialization/foundations/serialization-basics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"formats","title":"格式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-save-serialization/formats","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"binary-vs-text","title":"二进制与文本格式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-save-serialization/formats/binary-vs-text"},{"seq":2,"slug":"schema-evolution","title":"模式演进与版本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-save-serialization/formats/schema-evolution"},{"seq":3,"slug":"compression-encryption","title":"压缩与加密","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-save-serialization/formats/compression-encryption"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"techniques","title":"技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-save-serialization/techniques","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"snapshot-vs-delta","title":"快照与增量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-save-serialization/techniques/snapshot-vs-delta"},{"seq":2,"slug":"object-graph-references","title":"对象图与引用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-save-serialization/techniques/object-graph-references"},{"seq":3,"slug":"streaming-large-worlds","title":"大世界流式存档","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-save-serialization/techniques/streaming-large-worlds"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-save-serialization/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"save-slots-cloud","title":"存档槽与云同步","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-save-serialization/practice/save-slots-cloud"},{"seq":2,"slug":"corruption-recovery","title":"损坏与恢复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-save-serialization/practice/corruption-recovery"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pitfalls","title":"陷阱与边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-save-serialization/practice/pitfalls"}]}]}